.TH SDL_SECONDS_TO_NS 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_SECONDS_TO_NS \- Convert seconds to nanoseconds.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_timer.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_SECONDS_TO_NS(S)    (((Uint64)(S)) * SDL_NS_PER_SECOND)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This only converts whole numbers, not fractional seconds\[char46]

.SH MACRO PARAMETERS
.TP
.I S
the number of seconds to convert\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns S, expressed in nanoseconds\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this macro from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

